            {
                "category": "summary",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae Networking BlueField, ConnectX.&nbsp;<div>To protect your system, download and install the latest NVIDIA firmware from the links provided in this bulletin.</div>",
                "title": "Summary"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "To protect your system, download and install the latest NVIDIA components from the links provided in this document.",
                "title": "Security Update Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "Product -&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(17, 22, 30);\">Download Link</span><div>ConnectX-5 FW -&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(17, 22, 30);\"><a href=\"https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx5en/\">https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx5en/</a></span></div><div>ConnectX-6 DE FW -&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(17, 22, 30);\"><a href=\"https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx6de/\">https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx6de/</a></span></div><div>ConnectX-6 DX FW -&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(17, 22, 30);\"><a href=\"https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx6dx/\">https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx6dx/</a></span></div><div>ConnectX-6 LX FW -&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(17, 22, 30);\"><a href=\"https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx6lx/\">https://network.nvidia.com/support/firmware/connectx6lx/</a></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(17, 22, 30);\">For other versions, contact your account manager or CPM.</span></div><div><br></div>",
                "title": "Mitigation Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "This issue was found internally.",
                "title": "Bulletin Notes"
            },
